---
import Page from "../components/Page.astro"
import { site } from "../site.config"
---

<Page site={site} title={`Privacy | ${site.name}`} description={`How ${site.name} uses the details you send.`} path="/privacy">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:44rem">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>The quote form asks for your name, phone number, ZIP code and a few details about the job. We use them to send you a price and schedule the cleaning, and we pass them only to the local cleaning company that will do the work.</p>
      {site.flags.photoUpload && <p>If you add photos, they're stored privately, seen only by the cleaner quoting your job, and deleted after 180 days.</p>}
      <p>Your details are never sold or used for ads.</p>
      <p>Want your details removed? Say so in a quote request and we'll delete them.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
